	(text "CHASSIS is the chassis strip along the rear edge: jack sleeves and the jacks' RF and TVS parts. It meets the case at MH1 (near the jacks) only; circuit GND meets the chassis at D's bond hole only (architecture 7). MH2 to MH4: insulating standoffs."
